      "value": "@{62dee557df9d6f563542d6bd|full_name}: night vision shader on avatar ✓\n\nThere are better ways to do this than gamma.  I recently prototyped a fake light shader that does essentially the same thing as adding a light to a scene, except it's an extremely inexpensive post effect overlay; it looks like an actual light if you don't study shading/shadows, and it can even clamp out HDR bloom... and that wasn't even the most visually accurate method that could be done.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
