      "value": "@{5a766b8a0868b44b53569ce4|full_name}: I already clamp out HDR by disabling post processing in all worlds using my avatar. I would like to make a overlay which makes the world unlit. I don't care at all about what the artist intended anymore. It's not worth sacrificing my ability to join most worlds and not have any vision issues.\n\nFor Ark, it's the devs fault for making nights too dark",
      "viewerReactions": null,
